# The chat model Jarvis uses: `ollama create qwen3.5-4b-64k -f deploy/ollama/Modelfile` (install.sh does it).
# Qwen3.5 4B (Apache 2.0). 64k context, because Hermes needs at least 64,000 tokens: only 8 of its 32 layers keep
# the whole conversation in memory, so 64k takes about 4.5 GB in all (Qwen3 4B took 8 GB). Its thinking mode is
# switched off on every request (Hermes's reasoning_effort: none; "think": false in Jarvis's own calls); the
# sampling is Qwen's advice for replies without thinking. install.sh may add num_thread (JARVIS_MODEL_THREADS).
FROM qwen3.5:4b-q4_K_M
PARAMETER num_ctx 65536
PARAMETER temperature 0.7
PARAMETER top_p 0.8
PARAMETER top_k 20
PARAMETER min_p 0
PARAMETER presence_penalty 1.5
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1
